      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Jobs live in memory and disappear when MCP stops. One runner job at a time; file lock serializes linked sessions.\nSelected source snapshot is rechecked at get_job; temporary worktree is removed after processing.\nNo automatic resend after uncertain delivery. Checks are caller-supplied argv; Codex reviews their reported outcomes.\nRequest cap: 55,000 chars · failures remain attention, quota, failed, or cancelled.",
      "originalText": "Jobs live in memory and disappear when MCP stops. One runner job at a time; file lock serializes linked sessions.\nSelected source snapshot is rechecked at get_job; temporary worktree is removed after processing.\nNo automatic resend after uncertain delivery. Checks are caller-supplied argv; Codex reviews their reported outcomes.\nRequest cap: 55,000 chars · failures remain attention, quota, failed, or cancelled.",
